WEBVTT

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:05.100
A shoot chain!

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:06.860
What incredible power!

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:21.290
Hey, track team!

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:23.710
What the hell was up with that dribbling?

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:25.330
You looked like you were going in slow mo!

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:28.000
You...!

00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:35.770
What's wrong with these guys?!

00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:39.350
We're the representatives here! Let us win!

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:04.040
Guys!

00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:07.280
We can't just end today on a note like that.

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:08.000
Yeah!

00:01:09.220 --> 00:01:12.130
It's a big challenge for the three of us, too.

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:18.550
I can't do nothing with myself after losing like that.

00:01:19.910 --> 00:01:22.720
We all feel the same.

00:01:26.170 --> 00:01:27.900
I won't let it end with me running away all the time.

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:38.220
Bring it!

00:01:38.220 --> 00:01:39.950
I'll stop them all!

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:21.720
Tenma!

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:23.930
Tsurugi!

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:31.970
Tenma.

00:03:31.970 --> 00:03:34.390
Why not try attacking more from the sides?

00:03:34.390 --> 00:03:35.510
Okay.

00:03:35.510 --> 00:03:39.100
I'll try it out while imagining myself jumping through the other team's open spaces.

00:03:40.130 --> 00:03:42.260
Okay, Tsurugi! One more time!

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:43.110
Yeah!

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:56.570
What are the others doing?

00:03:56.570 --> 00:03:58.840
Practice started a long time ago!

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:09.930
Tenma!

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:11.860
Aoi.

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:12.730
Come here a sec!

00:04:49.840 --> 00:04:51.970
They've been here long before breakfast.

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:54.220
That early?

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:55.640
Yeah.

00:04:55.640 --> 00:04:57.550
The finals are close.

00:04:57.550 --> 00:04:58.970
They're all getting serious.

00:04:58.970 --> 00:04:59.520
Yeah.

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:04.620
Damn it!

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:07.530
Soccer will eat me up, you say?

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:11.290
I'll eat <i>it</i>  up instead!

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:18.080
I won't run away!

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:19.380
I'll conquer this without running away!

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:24.300
Since we've come this far, I don't want to lose!

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:27.480
I'm not done yet! Damn it!

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:28.340
I won't give up!

00:05:29.020 --> 00:05:33.480
They all finally understand your feelings towards soccer.

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:35.750
Tenma?

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:39.190
Yeah...

00:05:39.660 --> 00:05:41.080
What's wrong?

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:46.990
We've managed to work things out so far by doing the best we could, but that won't be enough to fight the finals.

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:51.420
We can't win using the same methods as before.

00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:53.870
That's what Fudou-san and the others taught us.

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:59.570
But Tenma, they're starting to face soccer in their own way.

00:05:59.910 --> 00:06:03.240
Yeah, and I'm really happy about that.

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:03.750
But...

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:05.880
But?

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:08.860
I feel like there's something we're missing...

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:14.820
I can't put my finger on it, but...

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:18.590
What are you thinking?!

00:06:18.590 --> 00:06:22.080
We're facing the finals soon, <i>the finals!</i>

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:30.410
Why you would wish to crush Japan's representative team is unfathomable to me!

00:06:30.770 --> 00:06:35.100
Coach Kuroiwa, you <i>do</i>  intend to take responsibility for this, do you?!

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:40.390
Oh, for crying out loud!

00:06:40.390 --> 00:06:43.340
I can't believe this man is the representative coach!

00:06:46.530 --> 00:06:50.550
Your command has never gone wrong before.

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:51.140
However...

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:54.370
Will they be able to win the finals?

00:06:56.950 --> 00:06:58.600
A foolish question.

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:11.200
Here we go, Ibuki-kun.

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:12.950
Okay! Bring it on!

00:07:18.570 --> 00:07:19.570
Hakuryuu!

00:07:19.570 --> 00:07:20.830
That's just a hologram.

00:07:21.840 --> 00:07:27.110
I've inputted it with all the possible data I could find on Resistance Japan's ace striker, Hakuryuu-san.

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:28.680
I see.

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:31.080
So it has the same power as the real thing.

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:33.680
The force of his shoot can be replicated to perfection.

00:07:35.460 --> 00:07:36.430
Nice.

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:37.800
Shoot at me!

00:07:37.800 --> 00:07:39.060
I'll stop them all!

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:47.770
Give me more!

00:07:50.020 --> 00:07:52.420
I need a hissatsu technique.

00:07:52.420 --> 00:07:56.260
The more we win, the stronger the opponents are.

00:07:57.080 --> 00:08:01.060
I need to learn a hissatsu technique of my own too.

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:04.460
There's not a chance that I can't do it!

00:08:14.880 --> 00:08:16.550
Is this for the best?

00:08:25.040 --> 00:08:29.480
We've already rested for 4 minutes and 36 seconds...

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:32.150
That's too long.

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:33.490
Time to start up again!

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:35.550
I'll block them all!

00:08:35.550 --> 00:08:36.620
Hakuryuu is no threat!

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:40.370
We have to continue with training...

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:41.770
That's right!

00:08:41.770 --> 00:08:44.830
We have to level up more!

00:08:45.770 --> 00:08:49.420
I'm going to try training on the next level.

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:56.440
Next one!

00:08:57.950 --> 00:09:00.280
Ibuki, it's time you took a break, yeah?

00:09:00.280 --> 00:09:01.390
I'm fine!

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:04.350
I don't need a break against a shoot like this!

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:09.660
Ibuki, I heard that you volunteered to be goalkeeper.

00:09:09.660 --> 00:09:10.900
Why did you choose that position?

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:13.680
Because...

00:09:14.480 --> 00:09:17.100
There's only one goalkeeper on the field.

00:09:17.370 --> 00:09:22.040
You're able to fight using your own abilities, without having to depend on anyone else.

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:26.210
I chose to be goalkeeper because I was attracted to that.

00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:29.370
I've been training all this time.

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:33.630
My power and force couldn't possibly lose to anyone right now.

00:09:34.350 --> 00:09:37.280
I should be the perfect goalkeeper.

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:38.930
Just like basketball!

00:09:40.310 --> 00:09:41.990
No. You don't belong here.

00:09:41.990 --> 00:09:42.600
What?!

00:09:43.170 --> 00:09:46.860
Someone like you isn't fit for the goalkeeper position.

00:09:46.860 --> 00:09:47.600
You never will be.

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:49.860
Say that again?!

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:52.770
Shindou-san, that's not very fair.

00:09:53.350 --> 00:09:56.310
He's been training really hard in his own way.

00:09:56.310 --> 00:09:58.990
It's time you acknowledged him.

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:06.540
Having a hissatsu technique doesn't mean you can block shoots all the time.

00:10:07.190 --> 00:10:09.460
Soccer isn't that simple.

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:20.110
Damn it!

00:10:22.280 --> 00:10:24.310
Everyone, please take your seats.

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:25.680
We're starting the meeting.

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:28.220
We're claiming absence today.

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:29.140
Why?

00:10:29.930 --> 00:10:33.520
Our main priority right now is training in the Black Room.

00:10:34.220 --> 00:10:39.110
We only have 58 hours 27 minutes and 15 seconds left until the finals.

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:42.240
We want to get better even if it's just a little bit!

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:43.580
Guys, listen!

00:10:44.460 --> 00:10:49.210
Practicing on your own is important, but with that alone, I get the feeling that we're missing something.

00:10:50.060 --> 00:10:55.260
I'm sure that it will be worth your time if we talk together about matches and formations.

00:10:57.640 --> 00:10:59.220
I'll do what Captain says.

00:10:59.420 --> 00:11:01.020
Very well.

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:02.090
Let's begin then, quickly.

00:11:05.130 --> 00:11:10.220
As you already know, your opponent for the finals is Uzbekistan's Storm Wolf.

00:11:10.220 --> 00:11:12.600
What we should be cautious of is their powerful offense.

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:15.020
Right, Manabe-kun?

00:11:15.260 --> 00:11:20.700
As you can see, they hold the highest score of 20 total points in the tournament up to the semi-finals.

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:28.660
How we'll stand against a team that specializes in offense will be determined by the actions of us defenders.

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:30.330
That will be the turning point on who wins and loses.

00:11:31.840 --> 00:11:36.800
No matter how hard the defense tries, there's no point if our goalkeeper has butterfingers.

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:40.590
Hey, Ibuki!

00:11:41.440 --> 00:11:42.970
You're not dismissed yet!

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:44.840
Wait! Hey!

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:50.770
Now, what will the captain do?

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:02.510
Where's Ibuki?

00:12:02.510 --> 00:12:03.820
He's still practicing.

00:12:04.730 --> 00:12:06.410
He's not even eating dinner?

00:12:07.060 --> 00:12:09.530
I'm worried about him, Captain.

00:12:09.530 --> 00:12:10.540
About Ibuki?

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:16.000
That's great, that's great! What perfect timing, you two!

00:12:16.530 --> 00:12:18.460
Here, here. Take this, take this.

00:12:18.970 --> 00:12:19.950
Auntie?

00:12:19.950 --> 00:12:22.710
They're rice balls! Rice balls!

00:12:23.440 --> 00:12:26.310
Ibuki-kun hasn't eaten yet, right?

00:12:26.310 --> 00:12:28.820
Take that to him.

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:31.330
Okay, I got it!

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:32.260
Then I'll come along.

00:12:32.260 --> 00:12:33.770
Auntie, thanks!

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:34.550
Let's go!

00:12:34.550 --> 00:12:35.510
Okay!

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:41.370
Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy!

00:12:43.510 --> 00:12:46.550
Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy!

00:12:59.950 --> 00:13:04.200
I'll become a goalkeeper that can stop any shoot!

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:05.680
Why don't you take a break first?

00:13:07.570 --> 00:13:08.180
Captain.

00:13:09.150 --> 00:13:10.590
Here, rice balls.

00:13:10.590 --> 00:13:12.010
Auntie made them.

00:13:12.010 --> 00:13:13.350
O-Okay...

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:21.210
You should at least eat when it's time to eat.

00:13:21.210 --> 00:13:23.060
Soccer isn't going to run from you.

00:13:23.060 --> 00:13:26.060
If you'd only told me, I'll help you out with practice any time.

00:13:26.060 --> 00:13:28.100
I can concentrate better when I'm alone.

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:33.080
I've always practiced alone.

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:34.700
Even in basketball?

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:38.590
There's no point practicing with someone who isn't any good.

00:13:39.120 --> 00:13:42.750
I heard you were part of a strong team that could make it to the championship.

00:13:42.750 --> 00:13:43.920
Yeah.

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:46.570
Because of me.

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:50.430
We were able to win because I made the points.

00:13:51.150 --> 00:13:52.680
That's all.

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:54.390
That's the style that best suits me.

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:58.720
That's why I'm going to continue doing this on my own.

00:13:59.170 --> 00:14:01.260
Hey, that's not-

00:14:00.100 --> 00:14:02.750
Okay, time to get back to practice!

00:14:03.810 --> 00:14:05.300
Bring it!

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:10.660
All right, it worked!

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:12.030
I'm raising the level!

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:13.540
Kusaka, push it up to level 3!

00:14:14.860 --> 00:14:15.580
Okay.

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:18.800
You're really going at it, Ibuki!

00:14:18.800 --> 00:14:19.460
Guys!

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:22.460
The lowest level we can fight the finals in is level 4.

00:14:22.930 --> 00:14:26.720
Watch me, Captain! I'll clear it no matter what!

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:30.750
We have one hour and 48 minutes until bedtime.

00:14:30.750 --> 00:14:32.480
We'll train up to the very last minute!

00:14:35.820 --> 00:14:37.480
Level 3 cleared!

00:14:40.820 --> 00:14:43.040
Nozaki-san, are you on level 2?

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:44.390
I'm on 3!

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:47.360
I haven't even cleared level 2 yet!

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:53.620
Raise the level higher!

00:14:55.280 --> 00:14:56.480
Wow...

00:14:56.920 --> 00:15:00.880
Everyone's clearly improving during this short time span.

00:15:01.430 --> 00:15:07.880
If each of us levels up in power, it raises the level of the team.

00:15:08.830 --> 00:15:10.590
I know that.

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:12.430
I know that, but...

00:15:22.030 --> 00:15:24.480
Is this really for the best?

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:30.570
How's that?

00:15:31.040 --> 00:15:32.300
Awesome!

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:35.490
There's nothing that I can't do!

00:15:36.220 --> 00:15:38.040
I'll stop whatever shoot comes my way!

00:15:44.800 --> 00:15:46.550
Did you see that, Shindou?

00:15:46.550 --> 00:15:48.680
I'm like a wall of iron!

00:15:49.530 --> 00:15:51.460
I won't let a single goal get through me!

00:15:51.460 --> 00:15:52.550
Wait, Shindou!

00:15:52.990 --> 00:15:55.170
Only I will protect the goal!

00:15:55.170 --> 00:15:57.570
The ten of you, go get points!

00:15:57.570 --> 00:15:58.930
Shindou, that includes you!

00:16:01.370 --> 00:16:02.350
Ibuki.

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:06.480
Is getting the ball with your own hands what you consider a good play?

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:09.230
What do you mean?

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:09.940
Tell it to me straight.

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:14.030
If you didn't understand what I just said, then you'll never improve.

00:16:15.100 --> 00:16:17.490
What?! What are you trying to say?!

00:16:25.550 --> 00:16:27.300
Don't get so worked up.

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:28.500
Here.

00:16:28.770 --> 00:16:30.500
Damn it!

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:41.970
What?

00:16:47.990 --> 00:16:49.000
Huh?

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:50.150
Aren't those boys...?

00:16:51.260 --> 00:16:52.650
Those are Matatagi's brothers.

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:55.660
Hey, you two.

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:58.210
Did you come here to see Matatagi?

00:16:58.210 --> 00:16:59.230
Yeah.

00:16:59.230 --> 00:17:02.330
You'll both come to watch the finals, right?

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:04.040
We'll be counting on you to cheer for us.

00:17:05.860 --> 00:17:07.670
Are you not able to come that day?

00:17:08.060 --> 00:17:09.000
No.

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:11.320
We'll go. We'll definitely go.

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:12.480
But...

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:13.750
But?

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:17.180
Nii-chan said winning the championship is probably impossible.

00:17:18.280 --> 00:17:23.010
But since we don't want to see Nii-chan lose, we'll cheer for you!

00:17:23.010 --> 00:17:24.460
We'll cheer lots!

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:27.190
Yeah! I'm sure we'll win!

00:17:28.280 --> 00:17:29.860
Well, do your best!

00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:31.320
Bye bye!

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:32.950
Bye bye...

00:17:33.930 --> 00:17:37.150
They must have heard him wrong.

00:17:37.150 --> 00:17:38.110
Aoi...

00:17:38.110 --> 00:17:41.970
Matatagi-kun's brothers are still so young.

00:17:41.970 --> 00:17:43.500
Yeah.

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:47.830
Matatagi would never say that the championship is impossible...

00:17:52.310 --> 00:17:54.570
The time has come.

00:17:54.570 --> 00:17:55.390
Yes.

00:17:58.410 --> 00:18:04.930
Football Frontier International Vision 2's Asia district preliminaries has reached its finals!

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:11.100
Here at Holy Road Stadium, the representative for Asia will be decided!

00:18:16.100 --> 00:18:20.990
We're all moving differently now than when we fought against Resistance Japan.

00:18:21.920 --> 00:18:23.990
Well, we've all gone through tough training.

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:24.910
I sure want to win!

00:18:25.720 --> 00:18:28.030
I won't let in a single point today.

00:18:28.030 --> 00:18:30.150
I'll hold them back with a perfect score.

00:18:34.900 --> 00:18:36.550
Watch me, Shindou.

00:18:37.150 --> 00:18:40.390
I'm going to make you approve of me in today's match!

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:48.030
Known as the eye of the hurricane in this tournament is Uzbekistan's Storm Wolf!

00:18:48.320 --> 00:18:56.320
From their wild team colors and offense, they've scored 20 points total so far with their Captain Dmitri and Maxim at the center!

00:18:56.610 --> 00:19:00.970
Against them, with their captain Matsukaze at the center, is Japan's Inazuma Japan,

00:19:00.970 --> 00:19:06.830
who made numerous turnabout victories without giving up to the end to reach the finals!

00:19:07.150 --> 00:19:08.790
Nii-chan, you can do it!

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:10.210
Make lots of goals!

00:19:12.810 --> 00:19:17.130
A team of newbies who won by a fluke... 
 I'll crush you with the palm of my hand.

00:19:18.080 --> 00:19:19.430
You know what to do.

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:23.640
You all endured your training well.

00:19:23.840 --> 00:19:27.770
I just know soccer was watching over you as you worked hard.

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:31.390
The more you face it seriously, the more soccer answers back to you.

00:19:31.390 --> 00:19:35.110
The world tournament lays ahead of these finals.

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:37.110
Let's win!

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:38.990
Yeah!

00:19:40.040 --> 00:19:45.430
How will Inazuma Japan stand up against Storm Wolf and their overwhelming offense?

00:19:45.430 --> 00:19:47.290
The kickoff will start momentarily!

00:19:47.800 --> 00:19:49.790
Guys, you can do it!

00:19:52.410 --> 00:19:54.020
We <i>will</i>  win!

00:19:54.020 --> 00:19:56.130
I'll lead everyone to victory!

00:19:57.390 --> 00:19:59.680
Now, the match begins!

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:01.220
Shindou!

00:20:01.810 --> 00:20:04.220
Today will be the last day you stand there.

00:20:09.240 --> 00:20:09.600
They're fast!

00:20:13.820 --> 00:20:14.770
No way!

00:20:14.770 --> 00:20:16.790
This has to be a mistake!

00:20:16.790 --> 00:20:19.030
We have to identify where that mistake is!

00:20:19.030 --> 00:20:22.300
Inazuma Japan is already in trouble!

00:20:22.300 --> 00:20:22.740
You...!

00:20:25.330 --> 00:20:25.780
Oh no!

00:20:26.110 --> 00:20:27.700
Now there's no one in my way!

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:28.540
Come shoot!

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:31.540
Gold Fever!

00:20:39.660 --> 00:20:41.130
Wild Dun-

00:20:50.570 --> 00:20:52.700
Storm Wolf makes the first point!

00:20:52.700 --> 00:20:56.150
Their swift offense surges right at the beginning of the match!

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:10.910
That... can't be...

00:22:58.020 --> 00:23:03.170
Inazuma All-Stars x TPK Character Song Album, "Kandou Kyouyuu!"

00:23:03.170 --> 00:23:06.530
